# VITE_SUPABASE_URL / VITE_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY: Public Supabase project URL and
# publishable key (sb_publishable_...), from Project Settings > API Keys. Both are bundled into the browser,
# so protect tables with Row Level Security. Never put a secret or service_role key here.
# Put real values in .env.local (ignored by git), not in this file.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=""
VITE_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=""
